text = "[b][i][font_size=27][color=b6ae9a]Interim[/color][/font_size][/i][/b] is a narrative experience exploring grief, loss, and complex human experiences. In playing, you will encounter themes and depictions of self-harm, physical injury, violence towards others, and substance misuse.

There are also flickering lights. (These can be reduced in Options)

If this experience provokes difficult feelings or thoughts of harming yourself, please seek support. You are not alone.

[b][i][font_size=27][color=b6ae9a]United States:[/color][/font_size][/i][/b] Call or text 988 to reach the Suicide & Crisis Lifeline.

[b][i][font_size=27][color=b6ae9a]Outside the United States:[/color][/font_size][/i][/b] Visit [url=www.findahelpline.com]findahelpline.com[/url] to find support resources in your country."
